  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.56,
      596.88,
      310.53,
      690.95
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of Land in total extent of 0.1685 Hec. depictedas Lots 01 and 02 in the Preliminary Plan No. fld 9849 preparedby the Surveyor General, situated in the village calledKaluaggala in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 436A ofSuduwella of Udugahapattuwa Minor Division in theDivisional Secretary's Division of Seethawaka (Hanwella) inColombo District of the Western Province and morefullydescribed as follows.",
