      437.09,
      562.42,
      509.03
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Unapandure Owita alias AttikkaghaOwita alias Unapandure Owita and Attikkagaha Owita atpresent Unapandure Waththa: Description: Home garden;Claimant: Kathriarachchige Don Fransis Lambert No. 120,Pahala Kaluaggala, Hanwella; Total Extent: 0.1663 Hectare.",
